        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is simply a visual novel game about reminiscing the past.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222340/extras/e5ddcde2439f9e222037d59ed4b3b0e4.avif?t=1777826761\" width=344 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and the girl named “<strong>Dirtie</strong>” stay together in this forgotten world. <br>There are no goals to reach, nothing you must accomplish. <br>You simply keep each other company, chatting idly about the old days — and that’s all there is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the screen to advance the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the options you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about what <strong>Dirtie</strong> says.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, <strong>Dirtie</strong> may say things that break the fourth wall, but you don’t need to worry about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Streaming of this game is welcome (whether monetized or not).</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is simply a visual novel game about reminiscing the past.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222340/extras/e5ddcde2439f9e222037d59ed4b3b0e4.avif?t=1777826761\" width=344 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and the girl named “<strong>Dirtie</strong>” stay together in this forgotten world. <br>There are no goals to reach, nothing you must accomplish. <br>You simply keep each other company, chatting idly about the old days — and that’s all there is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the screen to advance the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the options you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think about what <strong>Dirtie</strong> says.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, <strong>Dirtie</strong> may say things that break the fourth wall, but you don’t need to worry about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Streaming of this game is welcome (whether monetized or not).</i></p>",
        "short_description": "No matter how long you’re gone, there will always be a girl waiting for you in the same place. This is a story about forgetting, and about waiting. After countless restarts and countless memories lost… how long will you stay with her this time?",
        "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean",
